<title>USA: CBT Corp says to take Q3 charge $0.05/shr.</title>
<headline>CBT Corp says to take Q3 charge $0.05/shr.</headline>
<dateline>PADUCAH, Ky. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBT Corp will take a third quarter pre-tax charge of $560,000, or $.05 a share, from an assessment by the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>The one-time assessment mandated by Congress applies to approximately $100 million in deposits, the company said.</p>
<p>For the third quarter of 1995, CBT Corp earned $2.9 million, or $.37 per share.</p>
</text>
